isual state (checkbox and folding) immediately when changed by external scripts (e.g., `@tool` scripts). This is because these properties do not create an EditorProperty instance, thus bypassing the standard update mechanism based on `editor_property_map`.\r\n\r\nThis commit introduces a new `_toggle_sections` HashMap in `EditorInspector` to specifically track and update these sections. When a property change is requested or during auto-refresh, if the property is a section toggle, its associated `EditorInspectorSection` will now be updated directly.\r\n\r\nFixes: #107826 ","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2025-06-22T15:52:06Z","updated_at":"2026-02-07T12:35:08Z","closed_at":"2025-07-03T18:12:53Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":null,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"SmiterG:toggleable_section_inspector_fix","ref":"toggleable_section_inspector_fix","repo":{"id":916396500,"node_id":"R_kgDONp8Z1A","name":"godot","full_name":"SmiterG/godot","owner":{"login":"SmiterG","id":116043881,"node_id":"U_kgDOBuqwaQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/116043881?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SmiterG","html_url":"https://github.com/SmiterG","followers_url":"https